---
import { siteConfig } from "../config";
---

<section id="top" class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">{siteConfig.name} / {siteConfig.title}</p>
    <h1>17 岁，还在上高中，<br />产品已经卖出<em>约 425 单</em>。</h1>
    <p class="lead">一个人做产品、写代码、搞增长，也死磕 AI 的记忆、角色和人格复刻。</p>
    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn primary" href="#projects">看代表作 ↓</a>
      <a class="btn" href={siteConfig.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
    </div>
    <dl class="stats">
      {
        siteConfig.highlights.map((h) => (
          <div>
            <dt><b>{h.value}</b></dt>
            <dd><span>{h.label}</span></dd>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const hero = document.getElementById("top")!;
  hero.addEventListener("pointermove", (e) => {
    const r = hero.getBoundingClientRect();
    hero.style.setProperty("--x", `${e.clientX - r.left}px`);
    hero.style.setProperty("--y", `${e.clientY - r.top}px`);
  });
</script>
